Telegram was subject to a "takedown extortionist" who planted AI-modified child sexual abuse material (CSAM) to get Apple to remove the app from the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/app-store/">App Store</a>, Telegram CEO Pavel Durov <a href="https://x.com/durov/status/2084686326540996625?s=20">said today</a>. Apple <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/04/telegram-briefly-removed-from-app-store/">removed Telegram from the App Store</a> for about 40 minutes on Monday night after discovering CSAM, but reinstated the app after Telegram removed the content.<br/>
<br/>
